  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1PE 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ine apo ndi mukalamba munenu, ndemupapata imwe mwe bakalamba ba nkuta. Ine ndi kambone pafyo Kristu aculile, kabili nalikumako ku bucindami ubukesa sokoloka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.21.15+JHN.21.16+JHN.21.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoani 21:15-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi mulecema umukuni uo Lesa amupeela ukwangalila, teico pantu muli nokubomba lelo nico mulefwaya ukubomba ifyo Lesa alefwaya mubombe. Mwilabomba icofye mulefwaya amalipilo iyoo, lelo mulebomba ico mulefwaisha ukutumika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwilaumya bufumu ku bantu abo mwapeelwa ukubaka, lelo muleba icilangililo icakuti umukuni wakwa Lesa ulepashanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo Kacema mukalamba akamoneka, elyo mukapeelwa icilambu icacindama icishakonaike.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.3.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amap 3:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eifyo fine na imwe mwe balumendo mulenakila abakalamba. Elyo bonsefye muletumika abanenu mukuicefya. Pantu catila, “Lesa acincintila abacilumba, lelo abaicefya bena alabakwatila icikuuku.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.23.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mateo 23:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.14.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 14:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.18.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "18:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi muleicefya pa cinso cakwa Lesa uwamaka nganshi, umwine akamucindamika pa nshita alefwaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulemutuula amasakamiko yenu yonse, pantu eumusunga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muletekanya, kabili mulelola! Umulwani wenu Ciwa, endauka kwati ni nkalamo ilebuluma, ilefwaya uwakuti ikate imulye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mube ne cisumino icakosa, mulemwansha. Kabili mwalishiba ukuti ababwananyina banenu isonde lyonse balepita mu macushi ya musango umo wine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala mukaculafye akashita akanono. Elyo Lesa wacikuuku conse, uwamwita ico tuli muli Kristu kukukuma ku bucindami bwakwe ubwakubelelela, akamuwamya umupwilapo, akamupeela amaka, akamukosha mukabe abashangila icine cine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lesa e mwine maka pe na pe. Ameni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uyu kalata namulembela, mwipi. Ni Sailasi uo ine mona ukuti ni munyinefwe uwacishinka ewangafwako ukulemba. Ndefwaya ukumukoselesha no kwiminina bukambone ukuti uyu kalata e cikuuku cacine cine icakwa Lesa. Kanshi mushangile mucikatishe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ulukuta lunenu ulwa mu Babiloni",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5:13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Babiloni:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Limbi calola mukuti umusumba wa “Roma.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ulo Lesa asala nga imwe bene, lwamuposha, elyo no mwana wandi Mako amuposha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muleposhanya mukutomona",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5:14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ukutomona:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "E lutambi Abayuda balebomfya pakuposhanya.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kwa batemwana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umutende ube na imwe bonse imwe mwe baba muli Kristu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
